# Essence Channeler: "If Essence Channeler has -1/-1 counters on it when it dies, that ability will include those as well"
# (ruling 2024-07-26). Bot1 casts Requiting Hex at Bot2's Llanowar Elves and blights 1 onto its own Channeler (2/1), which dies
# with the -1/-1 counter as the spell is cast (CR 704.5f). Its trigger puts that -1/-1 counter on one of Bot1's Ornithopters
# (0/2 -> -1/1), not on the other. The Hex then destroys the Elves and Bot1 gains 2 life: the Channeler is gone and does not grow.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Plains
Essence Channeler
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Mox Jet
Requiting Hex
Plains x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Llanowar Elves
Island x5
Island x10

